  "description": "With the Altura CP City Power Plus you get a unisex electric bike with a low step-through frame and a unique, large front basket with a fixed bottom and a handlebar lock. The handlebar lock is especially practical when parking your bike with a heavily loaded front basket. The design is simple and stylish.\nEquipped with the powerful Bosch Active Plus motor and a battery mounted on the rear carrier, this bike is perfect for anyone who wants reliable support when riding uphill or against strong headwinds. The low step-through frame makes it easy to get on and off the bike, even when carrying loads in both the front basket and on the rear carrier.\nIt’s the ideal bike for all your daily rides as well as for longer, leisurely weekend trips. This bike is available in cooperation with Fri Bikeshop.",
